  "title": "Corn and Crab Bisque",
  "description": "Fresh corn cut from the cob and crab meat come together in this hearty, creamy, and easy to prepare bisque that’s spiced up with cayenne and Cajun seasonings.",
  "authors": [
    "TATTOOCHICC"
  ],
